Description: Qt6 GUI for MS SSO OpenConnect VPN
 A graphical user interface for Microsoft SSO-protected VPN servers,
 with adaptive MFA, automatic TOTP, system keyring credential storage,
 and support for Cisco AnyConnect and GlobalProtect.
 .
 Initial configuration downloads an isolated Playwright Chromium runtime.
 Existing working runtimes are reused on upgrade.
